### Civillist API — click "Send Request" above each block (REST Client extension).
### Pages like /officers or / return only an HTML shell; the DATA comes from PocketBase
### through the app's /pb proxy:  /pb/api/collections/<collection>/records
### Collections: meetings, ias_officers, ips_officers, other_contacts, employees, users

@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Is the app working?
GET {{host}}/api/health

### 2. Log in — run this first; the token is reused below as {{token}}
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "you@example.com",
  "password": "your-password"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Who am I?
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: {{token}}

### 4. IAS officers (what /officers?type=ias shows) — first 50, A–Z
GET {{host}}/pb/api/collections/ias_officers/records?perPage=50&sort=name
Authorization: {{token}}

### 5. IPS officers
GET {{host}}/pb/api/collections/ips_officers/records?perPage=50&sort=name
Authorization: {{token}}

### 6. Other contacts
GET {{host}}/pb/api/collections/other_contacts/records?perPage=50
Authorization: {{token}}

### 7. Search officers by name (PocketBase filter: ~ means "contains")
GET {{host}}/pb/api/collections/ias_officers/records?perPage=20&filter=(name~'kumar')
Authorization: {{token}}

### 8. Meetings (what the Meetings page / dashboard show) — newest date first
GET {{host}}/pb/api/collections/meetings/records?perPage=50&sort=-meeting_date
Authorization: {{token}}

### 9. Upcoming meetings only (on or after a date)
GET {{host}}/pb/api/collections/meetings/records?perPage=50&sort=meeting_date&filter=(meeting_date>='2026-10-05')
Authorization: {{token}}

### 10. One meeting by id (replace the id)
GET {{host}}/pb/api/collections/meetings/records/REPLACE_WITH_ID
Authorization: {{token}}

### 11. Employees
GET {{host}}/pb/api/collections/employees/records?perPage=50
Authorization: {{token}}

### 12. Log out
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: {{token}}
